========================================================================
sora-editor (unmodified Maven AAR)
========================================================================

Name: sora-editor (aka CodeEditor)
Maven: io.github.rosemoe:editor, io.github.rosemoe:language-java,
       io.github.rosemoe:language-textmate (BOM io.github.rosemoe:editor-bom:0.24.6)
Homepage: https://github.com/Rosemoe/sora-editor
Copyright: Copyright (C) 2020-2026 Rosemoe
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
License text: LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt
              https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.txt

Clankyard consumes sora-editor as unmodified Maven AAR artifacts. sora-editor
sources are not vendored in this tree.

Relink: a user may rebuild Clankyard substituting a modified sora-editor AAR
of the same coordinates (io.github.rosemoe:editor and language-* modules).
Corresponding source for Clankyard is this repository. Complete relink steps
will be documented in docs/licenses.md (CLANK-035).

Java syntax highlighting uses io.github.rosemoe:language-java (same LGPL
AAR; no separate TextMate grammar is shipped for Java).

